Section 13  Compliance Records


The Licensor may maintain records relating to
authorization verification, including:

(a) publicly accessible deployment addresses;

(b) authorization verification results;

(c) verification timestamps;

(d) publicly available deployment environment evidence.


Such records may be used as compliance verification
materials for enforcing this License.


